{"unit_id": "NOOB-P__dsh-chat-git#feature-turn-checkpoints", "repo": "NOOB-P/dsh-chat-git", "commit": "a69e004105d911cf13f1a2a42f3df0f4b38bed36", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-chat-git** 的功能「自动 Git 检查点」：对话开始时为工作目录确保 Git 仓库，并在回合结束且工作区有改动时暂存和提交文件；可通过设置调整提交间隔。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:500-528", "lib/git.js:339-348"]}
{"unit_id": "NOOB-P__dsh-chat-git#feature-history-view", "repo": "NOOB-P/dsh-chat-git", "commit": "a69e004105d911cf13f1a2a42f3df0f4b38bed36", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-chat-git** 的功能「对话与提交历史」：历史标签页按轮显示对话时间线及关联检查点，并列出工作区分支、状态和近期提交，支持从某轮分叉会话。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:1248-1285", "lib/index.js:616-650"]}
{"unit_id": "NOOB-P__dsh-chat-git#feature-restore-workspace", "repo": "NOOB-P/dsh-chat-git", "commit": "a69e004105d911cf13f1a2a42f3df0f4b38bed36", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-chat-git** 的功能「恢复工作区版本」：在历史面板选择仓库提交并确认后，将工作区内容恢复到该提交；HEAD 保持原位，之后新增的已跟踪路径会一并清理。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:732-769", "lib/git.js:327-348"]}
{"unit_id": "NOOB-P__dsh-chat-git#feature-edit-resend", "repo": "NOOB-P/dsh-chat-git", "commit": "a69e004105d911cf13f1a2a42f3df0f4b38bed36", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-chat-git** 的功能「编辑旧请求」：从历史轮次取回完整请求文本和图片，并在分叉出的会话输入框中预填，用户可以修改后自行决定是否发送。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:654-675", "lib/client.js:1853-1870", "lib/timeline.js:229-233"]}
{"unit_id": "NOOB-P__dsh-chat-git#caveat-model-title-privacy", "repo": "NOOB-P/dsh-chat-git", "commit": "a69e004105d911cf13f1a2a42f3df0f4b38bed36", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-chat-git 启用提交标题总结时，会把本轮用户请求和暂存变更摘要交给所选的 DSH 模型生成标题；设置为关闭后不调用模型总结。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:286-320", "lib/summarize.js:95-132"]}
